NextBSD: take Apple's current (stricter) behaviour on NextBSD.

Apple gates its hardening on dyld's "linked on or after" checks
(dyld_program_minos_at_least / dyld_program_sdk_at_least). Those exist only
on Darwin, so off __APPLE__ both linkedOnOrAfter*() helpers returned false
and NextBSD got the legacy 2.9.13 behaviour: no XPath operation/recursion
limits, XPointer locations live. Every NextBSD program is new code, so the
helpers return true here, and XPointer locations are disabled at run time as
they are on current Apple OSes.

The callers (xpath.c, xmlmemory.c, xpointer.c, and encoding.c's ICU
converter) only included xmlversionInternal.h under __APPLE__, so the
declaration was missing off Darwin; include it unconditionally.

linkedOnOrAfter2024EReleases() is only reached when the public headers
define LIBXML_HAS_DEPRECATED_MEMORY_ALLOCATION_FUNCTIONS, which they leave
undefined off Darwin, so the xmlMalloc family is unchanged.

--- a/xmlversion.c
+++ b/xmlversion.c
@@ -25,8 +25,15 @@
         result = dyld_program_minos_at_least(dyld_fall_2022_os_versions);
     });
     return result;
-#else
+#elif defined(__APPLE__)
     return false;
+#else
+    /*
+     * NextBSD: there is no dyld SDK or minimum-OS stamp to test, and every
+     * NextBSD program is new code, so always take Apple's current
+     * (stricter) behaviour.
+     */
+    return true;
 #endif
 }
 
@@ -39,7 +46,14 @@
         result = dyld_program_sdk_at_least(dyld_2024_SU_E_os_versions);
     });
     return result;
-#else
+#elif defined(__APPLE__)
     return false;
+#else
+    /*
+     * NextBSD: there is no dyld SDK or minimum-OS stamp to test, and every
+     * NextBSD program is new code, so always take Apple's current
+     * (stricter) behaviour.
+     */
+    return true;
 #endif
 }
--- a/xmlversionInternal.h
+++ b/xmlversionInternal.h
@@ -41,7 +41,8 @@
 
 #else /* __APPLE__ */
 
-#undef LIBXML_HAS_XPOINTER_LOCATIONS_DISABLED_AT_RUNTIME
+/* NextBSD: XPointer locations are disabled, as on current Apple OSes. */
+#define LIBXML_HAS_XPOINTER_LOCATIONS_DISABLED_AT_RUNTIME
 #undef LIBXML_LINKED_ON_OR_AFTER_MACOS13_IOS16_WATCHOS9_TVOS16
 
 #undef LIBXML_LINKED_ON_OR_AFTER_MACOS15_4_IOS18_4_WATCHOS11_4_TVOS18_4_VISIONOS2_4
